; margin:3pt; } p.Texto_Alinhado_Esquerda_Espacamento_Simples {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-align:left; word-wrap:normal; margin:6; } p.Texto_Alinhado_Esquerda_Espacamento_Simples_Alto {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-align:left; word-wrap:normal; margin:3; } p.Texto_Alinhado_Esquerda_Espacamento_Simples_Maiusc {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-align:left; text-transform:uppercase; word-wrap:normal; margin:0; } p.Texto_Alinhado_Esquerda_Negrito {font-weight:bold; font-family:Calibri; text-align:left; word-wrap:normal; margin:6pt; } p.Texto_Centralizado {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-align:center; word-wrap:normal; margin:6pt; } p.Texto_Centralizado_Assinatura {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-align:center; word-wrap:normal; margin:0 3pt 0; } p.Texto_Centralizado_Maiusculas {font-size:13pt; font-family:Calibri; text-align:center; text-transform:uppercase; word-wrap:normal; } p.Texto_Centralizado_Maiusculas_Negrito {font-weight:bold; font-size:13pt; font-family:Calibri; text-align:center; text-transform:uppercase; word-wrap:normal; } p.Texto_Espaco_Duplo_Recuo_Primeira_Linha {letter-spacing:0.2em; font-weight:bold; font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-indent: 12.303059895833334%; text-align:justify; word-wrap:normal; margin:6pt; } p.Texto_Fundo_Cinza_Maiusculas_Negrito {text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:bold; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-align:justify; word-wrap:normal; text-indent:0; margin:6pt; } p.Texto_Fundo_Cinza_Negrito {font-weight:bold; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-align:justify; word-wrap:normal; text-indent:0; margin:6pt; } p.Texto_Justificado {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-align:justify; word-wrap:normal; text-indent:0; margin:6pt; } p.Texto_Justificado_Maiusculas {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-align:justify; word-wrap:normal; text-indent:0; margin:6pt; text-transform:uppercase; } p.Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-indent: 12.303059895833334%; text-align:justify; word-wrap:normal; margin:6pt; } p.Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha_Esp_Simples {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-indent: 12.303059895833334%; text-align:justify; word-wrap:normal; margin:0 0 0 6pt; } p.Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha_Margem {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-indent: 12.303059895833334%; text-align:justify; word-wrap:normal; margin-left: 4.921223958333334%; } p.Titulo_centralizado_maiusculas {font-size:12pt; font-family:Calibri; text-align:center; text-transform:uppercase; word-wrap:normal; margin:0 0 0 6pt; }; background-color: transparent !important</style></head>\n<body style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"\" style=\";\"><em style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Disp&otilde;e sobre as regras, os fluxos e os procedimentos para a preven&ccedil;&atilde;o, identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o e mitiga&ccedil;&atilde;o do conflito de interesses, institui a rela&ccedil;&atilde;o de cargos com acesso a informa&ccedil;&otilde;es privilegiadas e disciplina a apresenta&ccedil;&atilde;o da Declara&ccedil;&atilde;o de Conflito de Interesses (DCI) no &acirc;mbito do Instituto de Pesos e Medidas do Estado de S&atilde;o Paulo - IPEM/SP, em observ&acirc;ncia ao Decreto Estadual n&ordm; 69.474, de 10 de abril de 2025, e &agrave; Resolu&ccedil;&atilde;o CGE n&ordm; 022, de 07 de outubro de 2026.</em></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">O PRESIDENTE DO INSTITUTO DE PESOS E MEDIDAS DO ESTADO DE S&Atilde;O PAULO (IPEM-SP), autarquia estadual, designado por meio do Decreto de 25 de mar&ccedil;o de 2026, publicado no Di&aacute;rio Oficial do Estado de 26 de mar&ccedil;o de 2026, da lavra do Governador do Estado de S&atilde;o Paulo, no desempenho de suas atribui&ccedil;&otilde;es legais, consignadas no <span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"line-height:107%; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot; Calibri&quot; ,&quot; sans-serif&quot; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0) !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">artigo 26 do Decreto n.&ordm; 70.362, de 04 de fevereiro de 2026;</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Considerando que incumbe ao Presidente adotar as provid&ecirc;ncias necess&aacute;rias para o regular e adequado funcionamento da autarquia;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Considerando o Decreto Estadual&nbsp;n.&ordm; 69.474, de 10 de abril de 2025, que disp&otilde;e sobre o conflito de interesses no &acirc;mbito da Administra&ccedil;&atilde;o P&uacute;blica direta e aut&aacute;rquica;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Considerando a&nbsp;resolu&ccedil;&atilde;o CGE n.&ordm; 022, de 07 de outubro de 2026, que disp&otilde;e sobre os procedimentos para a realiza&ccedil;&atilde;o de consulta sobre situa&ccedil;&otilde;es que possam configurar conflito de interesses e para a apresenta&ccedil;&atilde;o da Declara&ccedil;&atilde;o de Conflito de Interesses, e d&aacute; outras provid&ecirc;ncias;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Considerando ainda a necessidade de atualizar os normativos internos em virtude da &uacute;ltima reestrutura&ccedil;&atilde;o administrativa, institu&iacute;da por meio do Decreto n.&ordm; 70.362, de 04 de fevereiro de 2026.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><b style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">RESOLVE:</b></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Art. 1&ordm;</strong> &ndash;&nbsp;Arrolar os cargos, fun&ccedil;&otilde;es e empregos p&uacute;blicos, e suas respectivas unidades administrativas, que proporcionam acesso a informa&ccedil;&otilde;es privilegiadas, com potencial de gerar vantagem econ&ocirc;mica ou financeira ao ocupante ou a terceiro, em atendimento ao par&aacute;grafo &uacute;nico do artigo 2&ordm; do Decreto n&ordm; 69.474, de 10 de abril de 2025 e o artigo 3&ordm; da Resolu&ccedil;&atilde;o CGE n.&ordm; 022, de 07 de outubro de 2026.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<table style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t<tbody style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">CARGO, FUN&Ccedil;&Atilde;O E EMPREGO&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;UNIDADE ADMINISTRATIVA</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">UNIDADE ADMINISTRATIVA</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Presidente</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">PRESI</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Chefe de Gabinete</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">GABIN</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Diretor de Administra&ccedil;&atilde;o, Finan&ccedil;as e Recursos Humanos</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">DAFRH</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Coordenadora de Administra&ccedil;&atilde;o</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">CADMI</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Chefe da Divis&atilde;o de Aquisi&ccedil;&otilde;es e Contrata&ccedil;&otilde;es</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">DACON</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Chefe do Servi&ccedil;o de Licita&ccedil;&otilde;es e Compras</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">SELCO</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Coordenador de Finan&ccedil;as</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">COFIN</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Chefe da Divis&atilde;o de Finan&ccedil;as</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">DIFIN</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Chefe da Assessoria T&eacute;cnico-Administrativa</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">ASTAD</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Coordenador Geral de Recursos Humanos</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">CGRHU</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Coordenador Geral de Tecnologia da Informa&ccedil;&atilde;o</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">CGTIN</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td 