\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Chefe da Assessoria de Auditoria Interna</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">AUDIN</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Chefe da Assessoria de Correi&ccedil;&atilde;o</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">ASCOR</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Coordenadora de Ouvidoria</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">COUVI</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Coordenadora de Integridade</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">COINT</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Coordenador Geral de Gest&atilde;o Estrat&eacute;gica</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">CGEST</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Art. 2&ordm; &ndash;&nbsp;</strong>Cabe &agrave; Coordena&ccedil;&atilde;o Geral de Recursos Humanos (CGRHU) do IPEM-SP, cadastrar no Sistema Eletr&ocirc;nico Paulista de Conflito de Interesses (SPCI):</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" data-path-to-node=\"3\" style=\"margin-left: 5.208333333333334%; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" data-path-to-node=\"3\" style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">I</span> &ndash; os agentes p&uacute;blicos previstos nos incisos I a III do artigo 2&ordm;, os representantes do Estado previstos no artigo 13 do Decreto Estadual n&ordm; 69.474, de 10 de abril de 2025, e demais agentes p&uacute;blicos obrigados nos termos do &sect; 2&ordm; do artigo 3&ordm; desta Portaria, para que possam providenciar o preenchimento e envio da Declara&ccedil;&atilde;o de Conflito de Interesses (DCI);</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" data-path-to-node=\"4\" style=\"margin-left: 5.208333333333334%; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" data-path-to-node=\"3\" style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">II</span> &ndash; os membros da Unidade de Gest&atilde;o de Integridade (UGI), para atuarem na an&aacute;lise de consultas realizadas pelos demais agentes p&uacute;blicos da Autarquia, com o objetivo de dirimir d&uacute;vidas sobre conflito de interesses; e</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" data-path-to-node=\"5\" style=\"margin-left: 5.208333333333334%; ; background-color: transparent !important; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" data-path-to-node=\"4\" style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">III </span>&ndash; demais agentes p&uacute;blicos que desejarem solicitar a an&aacute;lise de situa&ccedil;&otilde;es que possam configurar conflito de interesses.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"Texto_Justificado_Recuo_Primeira_Linha\" style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif; color:rgb(0,0,0) !important; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">Art. 3&ordm; &ndash; </strong>Esta Portaria entra em vigor na data de sua publica&ccedil;&atilde;o, revogando-se as disposi&ccedil;&otilde;es em contr&aacute;rio, em especial a Portaria n&ordm; 089, de 30 de julho de 2025.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"\" style=\";\">S&atilde;o Paulo, na data da assinatura digital.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"\" style=\";\"><b style=\"background-color: transparent !important; ; background-color: transparent !important;\">LUIZ HENRIQUE DE ALMEIDA SILVA</b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"\" style=\";\">Presidente substituto</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n</body>\n</html>\n",
